# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debugging and tracing for the latest version of Samplomatic"
msgstr "Debugging dan tracing untuk versi terbaru Samplomatic"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debugging and tracing"
msgstr "Debugging dan tracing"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debugging and tracing {#debugging-and-tracing}"
msgstr "Debugging dan tracing {#debugging-and-tracing}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") function transforms an annotated circuit into a template circuit and samplex pair. In a complex circuit it can be hard to tell which box in the original circuit corresponds to which barriers in the template, or which nodes in the samplex DAG.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") mengubah circuit beranotasi menjadi pasangan template circuit dan samplex. Pada circuit yang kompleks, sulit untuk tahu box mana di circuit asli yang sesuai dengan barrier mana di template, atau node mana di DAG samplex.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Samplomatic provides two complementary tracing tools:\n"
msgstr "Samplomatic menyediakan dua alat tracing yang saling melengkapi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Barrier labels**: Every barrier in the template circuit carries a label that encodes its origin. These are always present regardless of whether `debug=True` is set.\n"
msgstr "**Label barrier**: Setiap barrier di template circuit membawa label yang mengodekan asalnya. Label ini selalu ada, terlepas dari apakah `debug=True` diatur atau tidak.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trace info on samplex nodes**: When [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") is called with `debug=True`, every samplex node carries a `TraceInfo` object linking it back to the box or boxes that produced it.\n"
msgstr "**Info trace pada node samplex**: Ketika [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") dipanggil dengan `debug=True`, setiap node samplex membawa objek `TraceInfo` yang menautkannya kembali ke box atau beberapa box yang menghasilkannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Both tools are most useful when boxes carry a [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") annotation, which attaches a `ref` string to the box. Alternatively, [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") references are also attached.\n"
msgstr "Kedua alat ini paling berguna ketika box membawa anotasi [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\"), yang menempelkan string `ref` ke box. Selain itu, referensi [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") juga ikut ditempelkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tag boxes {#tag-boxes}"
msgstr "Beri tag pada box {#tag-boxes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") annotation attaches a `ref` string to a box. The `ref` then appears in barrier labels and in trace information on samplex nodes.\n"
msgstr "Anotasi [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") menempelkan string `ref` ke sebuah box. `ref` itu lalu muncul di label barrier dan di informasi trace pada node samplex.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following example circuit has three boxes: two tagged CX boxes on disjoint qubit pairs, and an untagged right-dressed measurement box. The second CX box also carries an [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") annotation — both its `tag` ref and its noise `ref` will appear in the barrier labels. The two CX boxes cover different qubits, which enables the samplex optimizer to merge their propagation nodes into shared nodes. This is shown in the trace information section.\n"
msgstr "Circuit contoh berikut punya tiga box: dua box CX bertag pada pasangan qubit yang saling lepas, dan satu box pengukuran right-dressed tanpa tag. Box CX kedua juga membawa anotasi [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") — baik ref `tag`-nya maupun `ref` noise-nya akan muncul di label barrier. Kedua box CX mencakup qubit yang berbeda, sehingga optimizer samplex bisa menggabungkan node propagasi keduanya menjadi node bersama. Hal ini ditunjukkan di bagian informasi trace.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/f6b6fe7b60a39ba897814008443fa79b66213005462ab09f49ffc89aab1f3668.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/f6b6fe7b60a39ba897814008443fa79b66213005462ab09f49ffc89aab1f3668.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/f6b6fe7b60a39ba897814008443fa79b66213005462ab09f49ffc89aab1f3668.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/f6b6fe7b60a39ba897814008443fa79b66213005462ab09f49ffc89aab1f3668.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Barrier labels in the template circuit {#barrier-labels-in-the-template-circuit}"
msgstr "Label barrier di template circuit {#barrier-labels-in-the-template-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calling [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") on the circuit above produces a template whose barriers carry identifying labels. Each label has the form `{side}{scope}@{key=value&...}`:\n"
msgstr "Memanggil [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") pada circuit di atas menghasilkan template yang barrier-nya membawa label pengenal. Setiap label berbentuk `{side}{scope}@{key=value&...}`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Side**: `L` = left-dressing boundary, `M` = inner box content boundary, `R` = right-dressing boundary.\n"
msgstr "**Side**: `L` = batas left-dressing, `M` = batas isi dalam box, `R` = batas right-dressing.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Scope**: An integer index (or underscore-separated list for nested boxes) that distinguishes multiple boxes at the same nesting level.\n"
msgstr "**Scope**: Indeks bilangan bulat (atau daftar yang dipisahkan underscore untuk box bersarang) yang membedakan beberapa box pada level penyarangan yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Annotations**: An `@`-prefixed, `&`-separated list of `key=value` pairs derived from the box’s annotations. The `tag` key comes from a [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") annotation and `inject_noise` comes from an [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") annotation.\n"
msgstr "**Anotasi**: Daftar pasangan `key=value` berawalan `@` dan dipisahkan `&` yang diturunkan dari anotasi box. Key `tag` berasal dari anotasi [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") dan `inject_noise` berasal dari anotasi [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Barriers from untagged boxes carry only the side and scope (for example, `L2`), with no `@` suffix.\n"
msgstr "Barrier dari box tanpa tag hanya membawa side dan scope (misalnya, `L2`), tanpa akhiran `@`.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/e533d70a29504005a636aa27306d3ce3b1d2488358ac6a53f0674f2934698ab8.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/e533d70a29504005a636aa27306d3ce3b1d2488358ac6a53f0674f2934698ab8.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/e533d70a29504005a636aa27306d3ce3b1d2488358ac6a53f0674f2934698ab8.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/e533d70a29504005a636aa27306d3ce3b1d2488358ac6a53f0674f2934698ab8.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The barrier labels can also be extracted programmatically:\n"
msgstr "Label barrier juga bisa diekstrak secara programatik:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trace information on samplex nodes {#trace-information-on-samplex-nodes}"
msgstr "Informasi trace pada node samplex {#trace-information-on-samplex-nodes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Passing `debug=True` to [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") attaches trace information to every samplex node. Each node’s [`trace_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.Node.trace_info \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.Node.trace_info\") attribute is a `TraceInfo` object whose `trace_refs` dictionary maps annotation keys (for example, `\"tag\"` and `\"inject_noise\"`) to sets of ref strings. Nodes without a corresponding box annotation have `trace_info=None`.\n"
msgstr "Memberikan `debug=True` ke [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") menempelkan informasi trace ke setiap node samplex. Atribut [`trace_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.Node.trace_info \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.Node.trace_info\") tiap node adalah objek `TraceInfo` yang dictionary `trace_refs`-nya memetakan key anotasi (misalnya, `\"tag\"` dan `\"inject_noise\"`) ke himpunan string ref. Node tanpa anotasi box yang sesuai memiliki `trace_info=None`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When [`draw()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.draw \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.draw\") is called on a debug-built samplex, hovering over any node in the interactive graph reveals its `trace_refs` inside the hover tooltip.\n"
msgstr "Ketika [`draw()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.draw \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.draw\") dipanggil pada samplex hasil build debug, mengarahkan kursor ke node mana pun di grafik interaktif akan menampilkan `trace_refs`-nya di dalam tooltip hover.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trace information can also be inspected programmatically. Notice that some nodes carry references from both `'cx_ab'` and `'cx_cd'`. The samplex optimizer merged their parallel propagation nodes because the two boxes cover disjoint qubits and share a common predecessor from the right-dressed measurement box’s emission.\n"
msgstr "Informasi trace juga bisa diperiksa secara programatik. Perhatikan bahwa beberapa node membawa referensi dari `'cx_ab'` maupun `'cx_cd'`. Optimizer samplex menggabungkan node propagasi paralel keduanya karena kedua box mencakup qubit yang saling lepas dan berbagi predecessor yang sama dari emisi box pengukuran right-dressed.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To find all nodes that originate from a specific box, filter by the `\"tag\"` key:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menemukan semua node yang berasal dari box tertentu, filter berdasarkan key `\"tag\"`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "The samplex DAG {#the-samplex-dag}"
msgstr "DAG samplex {#the-samplex-dag}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The samplex returned by [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") is a directed acyclic graph (DAG) where **edges denote register dependency**. That is, an edge from node A to node B means B must wait for A to have acted on the shared virtual registers before B is allowed to act. This is not a temporal ordering like the DAG of a quantum circuit. Instead, the graph flows from nodes responsible for generating randomizations to nodes responsible for synthesizing them as outputs.\n"
msgstr "Samplex yang dikembalikan oleh [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") adalah directed acyclic graph (DAG) tempat **edge menyatakan dependensi register**. Artinya, edge dari node A ke node B berarti B harus menunggu A selesai bekerja pada register virtual bersama sebelum B boleh bekerja. Ini bukan urutan temporal seperti DAG pada circuit kuantum. Sebaliknya, grafik mengalir dari node yang bertugas menghasilkan randomisasi ke node yang bertugas mensintesisnya sebagai output.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are three node types, each with a distinct visual style in the interactive plot:\n"
msgstr "Ada tiga tipe node, masing-masing dengan gaya visual berbeda di plot interaktif:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Shape  | Color         | Type                                                                                                                                                             | Role                                                            |\n"
"| ------ | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Star   | Red           | [`SamplingNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-sampling-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.SamplingNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.SamplingNode\")         | Instantiates new virtual registers from a distribution or input |\n"
"| Circle | Green         | [`EvaluationNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-evaluation-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.EvaluationNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.EvaluationNode\") | Transforms, combines, or propagates virtual registers           |\n"
"| Bowtie | Blue / Purple | [`CollectionNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-collection-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectionNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectionNode\") | Reads registers and writes to `sample()` outputs                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Bentuk | Warna         | Tipe                                                                                                                                                             | Peran                                                           |\n"
"| ------ | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Bintang | Merah        | [`SamplingNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-sampling-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.SamplingNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.SamplingNode\")         | Membuat register virtual baru dari distribusi atau input |\n"
"| Lingkaran | Hijau      | [`EvaluationNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-evaluation-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.EvaluationNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.EvaluationNode\") | Mentransformasi, menggabungkan, atau mempropagasi register virtual           |\n"
"| Dasi kupu-kupu | Biru / Ungu | [`CollectionNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-collection-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectionNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectionNode\") | Membaca register dan menulis ke output `sample()`                |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execution proceeds in three phases:\n"
msgstr "Eksekusi berjalan dalam tiga fase:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All sampling nodes run first (in parallel).\n"
msgstr "Semua node sampling berjalan lebih dulu (secara paralel).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Evaluation nodes run next, in topological order (parallel within each generation).\n"
msgstr "Node evaluation berjalan berikutnya, dalam urutan topologis (paralel di dalam setiap generasi).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collection nodes run last (in parallel).\n"
msgstr "Node collection berjalan terakhir (secara paralel).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The graphviz layout reflects this. Sampling nodes appear at the top, collection nodes at the bottom.\n"
msgstr "Layout graphviz mencerminkan hal ini. Node sampling muncul di atas, node collection di bawah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hover tooltips {#hover-tooltips}"
msgstr "Tooltip hover {#hover-tooltips}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every node in the interactive visualization shows a tooltip when you hover over it. The tooltip contains the following information:\n"
msgstr "Setiap node di visualisasi interaktif menampilkan tooltip saat kamu mengarahkan kursor ke atasnya. Tooltip berisi informasi berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Node class name** and its integer graph index.\n"
msgstr "**Nama kelas node** dan indeks grafiknya yang berupa bilangan bulat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Register manifests**, which registers the node instantiates, reads from, writes to, and removes. These tell you how data flows between nodes.\n"
msgstr "**Manifest register**, yaitu register mana yang dibuat, dibaca, ditulis, dan dihapus oleh node. Ini memberi tahu bagaimana data mengalir antar node.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Node-specific details**, including the distribution type for sampling nodes, the operand for multiplication nodes, the template parameter indices for collection nodes, and so on.\n"
msgstr "**Detail khusus node**, termasuk tipe distribusi untuk node sampling, operand untuk node perkalian, indeks parameter template untuk node collection, dan seterusnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trace refs** (only when `debug=True`), which are the annotation keys and ref strings that link the node back to its originating boxes.\n"
msgstr "**Trace ref** (hanya saat `debug=True`), yaitu key anotasi dan string ref yang menautkan node kembali ke box asalnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clicking the plot and then hovering over individual nodes is the fastest way to understand what a given node does without reading source code.\n"
msgstr "Mengklik plot lalu mengarahkan kursor ke node satu per satu adalah cara tercepat untuk memahami apa yang dilakukan sebuah node tanpa membaca source code.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Samplex summary {#samplex-summary}"
msgstr "Ringkasan samplex {#samplex-summary}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before examining the visualization, `print(samplex)` gives a quick text summary of the node count, required inputs, and promised outputs.\n"
msgstr "Sebelum memeriksa visualisasi, `print(samplex)` memberi ringkasan teks singkat tentang jumlah node, input yang dibutuhkan, dan output yang dijanjikan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inspect registers {#inspect-registers}"
msgstr "Periksa register {#inspect-registers}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Passing `keep_registers=True` to [`sample()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample\") retains the intermediate [`VirtualRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/virtual-registers-virtual-register#samplomatic.virtual_registers.VirtualRegister \"samplomatic.virtual_registers.VirtualRegister\") objects that are live at the end of sampling, and stores them in `outputs.metadata[\"registers\"]`. Each register is a 2D array (shape `(num_subsystems, num_randomizations)`, with possible trailing gate-shape dimensions) of virtual group elements.\n"
msgstr "Memberikan `keep_registers=True` ke [`sample()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample\") mempertahankan objek [`VirtualRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/virtual-registers-virtual-register#samplomatic.virtual_registers.VirtualRegister \"samplomatic.virtual_registers.VirtualRegister\") perantara yang masih aktif di akhir sampling, dan menyimpannya di `outputs.metadata[\"registers\"]`. Setiap register adalah array 2D (bentuk `(num_subsystems, num_randomizations)`, dengan kemungkinan dimensi gate-shape tambahan di belakang) berisi elemen grup virtual.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is useful for verifying that virtual gates were combined correctly, or for inspecting the raw Pauli or unitary samples before they are synthesized into rotation angles.\n"
msgstr "Ini berguna untuk memverifikasi bahwa gate virtual digabungkan dengan benar, atau untuk memeriksa sampel Pauli atau unitary mentah sebelum disintesis menjadi sudut rotasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can view the contents of the end-state of a particular register. In the following example, the register has type [`PauliRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/virtual-registers-pauli-register#samplomatic.virtual_registers.PauliRegister \"samplomatic.virtual_registers.PauliRegister\"). See the `API documentation(/apidocs/index)`\\_\\_ for details about the storage format.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa melihat isi keadaan akhir dari register tertentu. Pada contoh berikut, register bertipe [`PauliRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/virtual-registers-pauli-register#samplomatic.virtual_registers.PauliRegister \"samplomatic.virtual_registers.PauliRegister\"). Lihat `API documentation(/apidocs/index)`\\_\\_ untuk detail tentang format penyimpanan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "How samplex nodes map to template parameters {#how-samplex-nodes-map-to-template-parameters}"
msgstr "Bagaimana node samplex dipetakan ke parameter template {#how-samplex-nodes-map-to-template-parameters}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `outputs[\"parameter_values\"]` array returned by [`sample()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample\") has shape `(num_randomizations, N)`, where `N` matches `len(template.parameters)`. Each column corresponds to one parameter in the template circuit — the i-th column fills in `template.parameters[i]`.\n"
msgstr "Array `outputs[\"parameter_values\"]` yang dikembalikan oleh [`sample()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample\") berbentuk `(num_randomizations, N)`, dengan `N` sama dengan `len(template.parameters)`. Setiap kolom sesuai dengan satu parameter di template circuit — kolom ke-i mengisi `template.parameters[i]`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`CollectTemplateValues`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-collect-template-values#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectTemplateValues \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectTemplateValues\") collection nodes are the link between virtual registers and template parameters. Each such node holds index information that records which columns of the output array it writes to. This makes it possible to trace which virtual gate subsystems drive which template parameters.\n"
msgstr "Node collection [`CollectTemplateValues`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-collect-template-values#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectTemplateValues \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectTemplateValues\") adalah penghubung antara register virtual dan parameter template. Setiap node seperti itu menyimpan informasi indeks yang mencatat kolom mana dari array output yang ditulisnya. Ini memungkinkan kita menelusuri subsistem gate virtual mana yang menggerakkan parameter template mana.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the \\{Samplex inputs and outputs}`samplex-io` guide to learn how to bind the sampled parameter values to the template circuit and run experiments.\n"
msgstr "Lihat panduan \\{Samplex inputs and outputs}`samplex-io` untuk mempelajari cara mengikat nilai parameter hasil sampling ke template circuit dan menjalankan eksperimen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic tagging {#automatic-tagging}"
msgstr "Tagging otomatis {#automatic-tagging}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When using [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\"), the `add_tags` parameter automatically adds [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") annotations to all boxes. Three modes are available:\n"
msgstr "Saat memakai [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\"), parameter `add_tags` secara otomatis menambahkan anotasi [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") ke semua box. Tersedia tiga mode:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`\"unique_instance\"`**: Assigns sequential `ref` (`t0`, `t1`, and so on) to boxes in circuit order. Every box gets a distinct `ref` regardless of its structure.\n"
msgstr "**`\"unique_instance\"`**: Memberikan `ref` berurutan (`t0`, `t1`, dan seterusnya) ke box sesuai urutan circuit. Setiap box mendapat `ref` yang berbeda, apa pun strukturnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`\"unique_box\"`**: Computes a structural hash of each box’s content and assigns the same `ref` to all structurally equivalent boxes. This is useful for grouping boxes by type rather than position.\n"
msgstr "**`\"unique_box\"`**: Menghitung hash struktural dari isi setiap box dan memberikan `ref` yang sama ke semua box yang strukturnya setara. Ini berguna untuk mengelompokkan box berdasarkan tipe, bukan posisi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`\"noise_ref\"`**: Copies the `ref` from each box’s [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") annotation and only tags boxes that have one. This is useful when meaningful noise refs already exist.\n"
msgstr "**`\"noise_ref\"`**: Menyalin `ref` dari anotasi [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") milik setiap box dan hanya menandai box yang punya anotasi tersebut. Ini berguna kalau noise ref yang bermakna sudah ada.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following example applies `\"unique_instance\"` and `\"unique_box\"` to a circuit whose two CX boxes are structurally equivalent. With `\"unique_instance\"`, each gets a distinct `ref`, while with `\"unique_box\"`, they share one.\n"
msgstr "Contoh berikut menerapkan `\"unique_instance\"` dan `\"unique_box\"` ke sebuah Circuit yang kedua box CX-nya setara secara struktural. Dengan `\"unique_instance\"`, masing-masing mendapat `ref` yang berbeda, sedangkan dengan `\"unique_box\"`, keduanya berbagi satu.\n"
